
 start a subagent under a name of your own and address it by that name


spawn subagent · anthropic/claude-opus-5@medium (Watching the build until stopped)
status tame-adder (watcher: Watching the build until stopped)
status watcher (Watching the build until stopped)
send watcher (Watching the build until stopped)
spawn subagent · anthropic/claude-opus-5@medium ✗ subagents[0].name "watcher" is already taken in t…
stop watcher (Watching the build until stopped)

The watcher answered to its alias.


 carry on


cat watcher 2L (Watching the build until stopped)

Carrying on.
